Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:18:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 162/202] [ae-patch] Tell the lead each turn which model and
 effort every role gets from its preset

The preset comes from the ae.team label's roles field when it names one of the
session owner's presets (or lead-picks), else the owner's default, read from the
omnigent-ae role_prefs store when installed and the Balanced starter otherwise.
The logic lives in omnigent/inner/ae_roles.py; ae_team.py only adds the resolved
roles to the notice metadata in every mode and appends the rendered block.
